OL,3,GNEWSA'Seek truth courageously' Pope
OL,4,Aurges Oxford college
OL,5,
OL,6,FA delegation from a University of
OL,7,FOxford college has been urged by the
OL,8,FPope to "seek the truth courageously"
OL,9,Fduring a private audience at the
OL,10,FVatican.
OL,12,FOn Friday, Pope Leo XIV met with a
OL,13,Fgroup from Oriel College, led by its
OL,14,FProvost Lord Mendoza, at the Apostolic
OL,15,FPalace next to St Peter's Square.
OL,17,FThe Papal audience comes a year after
OL,18,Fthe pontiff recognised former Oriel
OL,19,FCollege fellow Saint John Henry Newman
OL,20,Fas a Doctor of the Church.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
