OL,3,GNEWSA'Seek truth courageously' Pope
OL,4,Aurges Oxford college
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also marked the 700th anniversary of
OL,7,FOriel's royal foundation, in 1326, with
OL,8,Fthe pontiff celebrating the college's
OL,9,F"long and illustrious" history at
OL,10,FFriday's meeting.
